<title>USA: TENNIS-MONDAY'S FEATURED MATCHES AT THE U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MONDAY'S FEATURED MATCHES AT THE U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matches on the featured courts in Monday's opening day at the U.S. Open tennis championships at the National Tennis Centre (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Stadium (starting at 11 a.m., 1500 GMT)</p>
<p>16-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Angeles Montolio (Spain)</p>
<p>11-Malivai Washington (U.S.) v Karim Alami (Morocco)</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) v Jaime Oncins (Brazil)</p>
<p>Grandstand</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) v Tommy Haas (Germany)</p>
<p>6-Anke Huber (Germany) v Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S.) v Nicolas Lapentti (Ecuador)</p>
<p>Stadium evening session (starting 7:30 p.m., 2330 GMT)</p>
<p>15-Gabriela Sabatini (Argentina) v Patricia Hy-Boulais</p>
<p>(Canada)</p>
<p>6-Andre Agassi (U.S.) v Mauricio Hadad (Colombia)</p>
<p>Grandstand</p>
<p>David Wheaton (U.S.) v Kevin Kim (U.S.)</p>
